OL,3,AMoD has no email addresses for about   
OL,4,Ahalf of its reservists                 
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) is urging
OL,7,Freservists to update their contact     
OL,8,Fdetails, after it has emerged it does  
OL,9,Fnot have email addresses for about half
OL,10,Fof them.                               
OL,12,FThe UK has an estimated 95,000 members 
OL,13,Fin its strategic reserve force, which  
OL,14,Fis made up of veterans who can be      
OL,15,Frecalled in exceptional circumstances, 
OL,16,Fbut the MoD said it has only been able 
OL,17,Fto send letters to around 50,000.      
OL,19,FOpen letters have been published on the
OL,20,Fministry's website encouraging others  
OL,21,Fto "reconnect".                        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
