OL,3,AMoD has no email addresses for about   
OL,4,Ahalf of its reservists                 
OL,6,FOn Thursday Defence Secretary Wes      
OL,7,FStreeting confirmed that the MoD had   
OL,8,Fwritten to ex-military personnel to    
OL,9,Fcheck their contact details and skills 
OL,10,Fagainst the backdrop of a rising       
OL,11,F"threat environment".                  
